Note on data: this repository also bundles third-party open datasets under
data/raw/ and data/processed/ (Pakistan Bureau of Statistics census data,
OpenStreetMap extracts, KP Bureau of Statistics Development Statistics
reports, KP Health Care Commission facility registry, Marham.pk facility
listings). These datasets remain subject to their own original sources'
terms - see the "Data sources & attribution" section of README.md. The MIT
license above covers this repository's own code, not the redistribution
rights of the underlying third-party data itself.
